n it is not a file, FAIL when git is missing, never a bash from PATH, and the unchanged Unix /bin/sh with /usr/bin:/bin. TestHookEnvPath only joins a hand-built hookEnv."},{"id":"f-3bffcf","severity":"advisory","file":"internal/cli/doctor.go","line":174,"summary":"Additions beyond the verbatim request: env var CLAUDE_CODE_GIT_BASH_PATH (plan step 6), new doctor_test.go (step 5), CI windows-latest matrix (Q4) with shell: bash that also adds -eo pipefail --noprofile --norc on Linux (step 8), decisions 66-69 (AGENTS.md); all approved. Not in the plan: the fixed depth 3 in gitSh and a comment line in .gitattributes."}]}
